{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"cycling-power-calculator UI copy.fields.accuracyNote","detected_language":"ms","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"cycling-power-calculator.copy.fields.accuracyNote","keys":["cycling-power-calculator.copy.fields.accuracyNote"],"locale":"ms","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Kiraan kelajuan tetap, bukan bacaan meter kuasa atau preskripsi latihan. Ia menganggap jalan lurus dan keadaan tetap. Postur aero, tayar, permukaan jalan, drafting, pecutan, perubahan ketinggian dan cuaca boleh mengubah kuasa sebenar. Permintaan menuruni bukit negatif ditunjukkan sebagai sifar kerana model ini tidak mengira kuasa brek atau regeneratif.","record_id":"6ae0b143d299fca201834700088ae0795fa8b8a0f094c18fce8877a029994813","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":1.6924389629999723,"source":"Steady-speed estimate, not a power-meter reading or training prescription. It assumes a straight road and constant conditions. Aero posture, tires, road surface, drafting, acceleration, elevation changes and weather can change real power. Negative downhill demand is shown as zero because this model does not estimate braking or regenerative power.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"46eea6831c9daf692601a451c3aeb295cae916381bd504532f87c171fadd6b66","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Kiraan kelajuan tetap, bukan bacaan meter kuasa atau preskripsi latihan. Ia menganggap jalan lurus dan keadaan tetap. Postur aero, tayar, permukaan jalan, drafting, pecutan, perubahan ketinggian dan cuaca boleh mengubah kuasa sebenar. Permintaan menuruni bukit negatif ditunjukkan sebagai sifar kerana model ini tidak mengira kuasa brek atau regeneratif.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"density-calculator UI copy.additionalFaqs.2.answer","detected_language":"id","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"density-calculator.copy.additionalFaqs.2.answer","keys":["density-calculator.copy.additionalFaqs.2.answer"],"locale":"ms","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Masukkan massa dan volum setiap komponen pada barisnya sendiri. Alat membahagikan massa keseluruhan dengan volum keseluruhan dan menganggap volum komponen adalah aditif. Campuran sebenar boleh mengecil, mengembang, larut atau mengandungi ruang kosong, jadi volum akhir yang diukur lebih tepat apabila ia penting.","record_id":"6a0d9b494c1012e1ccb9fc1206812d52a5bcee104932c626e93bae223206740b","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":1.4391683288749846,"source":"Enter each component’s mass and volume on its own line. The tool divides total mass by total volume and assumes the component volumes are additive. Real mixtures may shrink, expand, dissolve or contain voids, so measured final volume is more accurate when that matters.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"25ccd26c48b5799c491ef1e6d713a516262e5f868a5ee18a9aa003fc5b646eb3","status":"needs-review","translation":"Masukkan massa dan volum setiap komponen pada barisnya sendiri. Alat membahagikan massa keseluruhan dengan volum keseluruhan dan menganggap volum komponen adalah aditif. Campuran sebenar boleh mengecil, mengembang, larut atau mengandungi ruang kosong, jadi volum akhir yang diukur lebih tepat apabila ia penting.","truncated":false,"warnings":["language_detection"]}
